<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (Club members want to post paid micro-bounties \(design a poster, fix a bug\) with the ETH locked upfront, but a plain "poster picks a winner" system has a problem: what if the poster goes silent and never picks anyone, leaving submitters' work unrewarded and funds stuck forever? You need a system with a built-in fallback so funds can never be permanently trapped, while still preventing the poster from just keeping the money without picking a winner.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
